    v
DynamoDB StudentRecords

Architecture choice  No API Gateway or Cognito resources are created in this classroom build. The later source notes proposed API Gateway/Cognito but then implemented a Lambda Function URL. This guide uses the fully specified Lambda Function URL path. AuthType NONE is classroom-demo-only; it is not production authentication.

