4. Troubleshooting
Symptom	Likely cause	Check / action
agentcore --version shows Python error	Old Starter Toolkit shadows npm CLI	Check which agentcore; remove old toolkit from active Python env; reopen terminal.
Local agent cannot invoke Nova Lite	Wrong profile, Region, credentials or model access	Check AWS_REGION, MODEL_INFERENCE_PROFILE_ARN and Bedrock profile access.
Greeting works but student query fails	Tool import/registration or local IAM permissions	Invoke StudentLookupTool directly; check student_tools.py and main.py; check local AWS identity.
Lambda returns no records	Wrong table, class value or GSI	Check StudentRecords, ClassScoreIndex and string Class values.
Deployed agent cannot invoke Lambda	Runtime role lacks permission	Check StudentLookupInvokePolicy on the actual Runtime role.
Runtime says not MMDSv2-enabled	Runtime metadata config not enabled	Repeat Step 19; requireMMDSV2 must be true; use a new session.
Proxy returns 500	Missing SDK client, IAM or wrong Runtime ARN	Check proxy logs, packaged Boto3 and AGENTCORE_RUNTIME_ARN.
Browser says Failed to fetch	CORS mismatch, Function URL permission or URL issue	Check exact origin, both Lambda permissions and curl test.
Function URL returns 403	One public Function URL permission missing	Check lambda:InvokeFunctionUrl and lambda:InvokeFunction resource permissions.
Browser displays raw data: events	SSE parsing mismatch	Inspect response.response and the extractAgentText parser.
CloudFront returns 403	OAC or bucket policy issue	Check OAC ID, S3 regional origin and AWS:SourceArn distribution condition.
CloudFront serves stale page	Cached object	Invalidate /chat.html and /, then wait for deployment.
Local page works but CloudFront page fails	CloudFront origin absent from Function URL CORS	Add exact https://<distribution-domain> to AllowOrigins.

